     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-08 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>ISCCM Organizes Critical Care Awareness Walkathon in Visakhapatnam</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Visakhapatnam branch of the Indian Society of Critical Care Medicine (ISCCM) will host a public walkathon this Friday to observe National Critical Care Day. Titled “Together We Walk, Together We Care,” the event begins at 6 a.m. at the Kali Mata Temple and follows a route toward Park Junction on Beach Road.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-08/isccm-organizes-critical-care-awareness-walkathon-in-visakha.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Organizers, including chairperson D. Sairama Devi and secretary Vara Lakshmi, aim to emphasize the importance of early recognition of life-threatening emergencies. The walkathon invites medical professionals, students, and the general public to highlight the role of critical care teams in saving lives through timely intervention and specialized treatment.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurate and well-structured summary of the upcoming awareness event in Visakhapatnam.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/isccm-to-hold-critical-care-awareness-walkathon-on-friday/article71560673.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/visakhapatnam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visakhapatnam</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
