       <h1>Pralhad Joshi Interacts with IIT Madras Students</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#Education</span> <span>#Pralhad Joshi</span> <span>#IIT Madras</span></div>
       <p>Pralhad Joshi engaged with students at IIT Madras, discussing topics related to innovation, aspirations, and the future of India. This interaction, reported by The Times of India, highlights the government's focus on youth engagement in key national development areas.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-08/pralhad-joshi-interacts-with-iit-madras-students.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>India Today further reported that Joshi also took a morning walk on the IIT Madras campus during his visit. This informal interaction provided an additional opportunity for the minister to connect with the student community.</p><p>What to watch: Future government-student dialogues.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft accurately synthesizes the provided source and supplementary context without adding external claims.</p>
