      <a href="/feed.xml" title="RSS">RSS</a>
      <button id="tdp-theme" title="Toggle light/dark">Light</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="catrow"><span class="catgrp"><b>News</b><a href="/category/national">national</a><a href="/category/world">world</a><a href="/category/defence">defence</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Money</b><a href="/category/business">business</a><a href="/category/finance">finance</a><a href="/category/education">education</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Sports</b><a href="/category/sports">sports</a><a href="/category/cricket">cricket</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Culture</b><a href="/category/entertainment">entertainment</a><a href="/category/positive">positive</a><a href="/category/funny">funny</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Life</b><a href="/category/science">science</a><a href="/category/environment">environment</a><a href="/category/space">space</a><a href="/category/health">health</a></span><span class="catgrp"><b>Tech</b><a href="/category/tech">tech</a><a href="/category/ai">ai</a></span></nav></div><div class="gtr"><span>Read in your language:</span><div id="google_translate_element"></div></div><div class="wrap"><main id="content"><p class="crumb"><a href="/">← Front page</a> · <a href="/archive">Archive</a> · <a href="/category/national">national</a></p>
     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-08 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Punjab Police Arrest Influencer Murder Suspect Using QR Code</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Punjab Police have arrested Parminder, alias Kaka, in Ahmedabad for the October 3 murder of social media influencer and make-up artist Mad Sandhu. Authorities traced the main shooter by having his brother, who was already in custody, send a digital QR code to Parminder; scanning the code revealed his precise location in Gujarat. A joint operation with the Gujarat Police facilitated the capture.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-08/punjab-police-arrest-influencer-murder-suspect-using-qr-code.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Five additional suspects, including Parminder's brother, have been arrested in connection with the killing. Police investigations indicate foreign-based gangster Goldy Dhillon claimed responsibility for the murder, which occurred on Amritsar's Loharka Road. Officials confirmed the suspects conducted a recce before the attack.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively summarizes the investigation and the specific method of tracing the suspect using the QR code.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/mad-sandhu-murder-case-punjab-police-arrest-main-shooter-in-ahmedabad-via-qr-code-ptag-3012800-2026-10-08?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
